Placeholder so the folder exists in git (git does not version empty directories).

Layout the MUSA builder expects:

    content/<collection>/
    ├── collection.json    # collection metadata
    └── <piece>/
        ├── ficha.json     # must validate against schemas/ficha.schema.json
        └── images/        # presentation images (2D)

Replace the `colecao_exemplo/peca_exemplo` scaffolding with real content.
Heavy assets (GLB, USD, print-resolution images) do NOT belong here: upload them
to the client bucket and reference them from ficha.json.
